 "summary": "The family product, the Hom-section and term products, and the chart converse for inhomogeneous terms have no counterpart in Mathlib or Tau Ceti, and they build on existing API (`ofContMDiff`, `contMDiff_hom_bundle_iff`/`contMDiff_hom_bundle_prod_iff`, `Bundle.Pullback.contMDiff_iff`/`contMDiff_lift`, `equivTangentBundleProd`, `ContinuousLinearMap.prod\u2097`). The nearest existing declarations (`ContMDiffAlmostComplexStructure.prod`/`prodFamily`, `InhomogeneousTerm.ext_tangentHom`, `mem_extChartAt_chartSourceCentre_source`) cover a different block structure, the term subtype, or the two-factor case, so none of them replaces the new declarations.",
